Subject: [PATCH 14/18] :white_check_mark: Exercise the complete producer C API

The additive producer interface outgrew the old C harness function count.
Exercise every declared entry point, status refusal, ownership transition,
and a real cached allocation with independent GPU readback. Complete the
sleep callback fixtures and verify both callback values and its absence.
